  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fcraftverse%253fr%253dzombieapocalypse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Zombie_Apocalypse_Last_Days_in_the_Wasteland/BH_Zombie_Apocalypse_Last_Days_in_the_Wasteland_header.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\"></span></strong></a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">你能在文明陷落後存活下來嗎？</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">殭屍啟示錄：廢土末日將你投入一片荒涼、充滿不死生物的絕望世界。文明已不復存在，空氣充滿毒性，大地正在崩毀。成群結隊的殭屍四處遊蕩，少數殘存的建築物裡，不是隱藏著危險……就是存活的希望。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>需要一個伺服器嗎？<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fcraftverse%253fr%253dzombieapocalypse\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">BisectHosting</span></a> 是遊玩此模組包的最佳選擇。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fcraftverse%253fr%253dzombieapocalypse\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Zombie_Apocalypse_Last_Days_in_the_Wasteland/BH_Zombie_Apocalypse_Last_Days_in_the_Wasteland_promo2.webp\" width=\"1401\" height=\"251\"></strong></span></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">和朋友一起玩殭屍啟示錄有趣多了，但架設伺服器或處理延遲問題卻很麻煩。我一直都在用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fcraftverse%253fr%253dzombieapocalypse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>BisectHosting</strong></span></a>，因為它穩定又順暢，如果你想試試，可以透過 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fcraftverse%253fr%253dzombieapocalypse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>這個連結</strong></span></a> 獲得首月 75折優惠。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Zombie_Apocalypse_Last_Days_in_the_Wasteland/BH_Zombie_Apocalypse_Last_Days_in_the_Wasteland_description.webp\" width=\"1401\" height=\"151\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">☢️ 核心特色</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🧟 無情的殭屍</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">感染者統治世界，動力來自 Infectious Zombie Apocalypse、Zombie Island、Day Zombies Rebooted、More Zombie Villagers、Extra Zombie Drops 和 Keerdm's Zombie Apocalypse Essentials。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">有了 Epic Siege Mod 和 AI Improvements，這些不死生物變得更聰明、更強壯，而且絕不留情。</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🌍 真實的廢土體驗</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Lost Cities 覆蓋大地，充滿廢棄的摩天大樓和破碎的道路。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Wastelands of Baedoor 將生態域重塑成毀滅性的放射性死亡地帶。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Tough As Nails 加入了硬核機制，例如口渴、體溫和季節變化。</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🧭 探索充滿危險</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">透過 Additional Structures 和 Explorify – Dungeons &amp; Structures，發現被遺忘的廢墟、地城和破碎的紀念碑。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">謹慎探索——許多地方都爬滿了不死生物。</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🛡️ 為生存而戰</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">透過 Security Craft、Torchmaster 和 Corail Tombstone 武裝自己並保衛你的避難所。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">使用 Farmer’s Delight、Comforts 和 Sophisticated Backpacks 確保存貨充足。</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🌫️ 強烈的氛圍</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">由 AmbientSounds、Enhanced Visuals、Sound Physics Remastered 以及 Insanity、Hysteria 或 Spooklementary 等光影包驅動的恐怖主題光影與音效。</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">⚙️ 穩定且優化</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">透過 ModernFix、FerriteCore、Radium Reforged、Clumps 和 Embeddium 進行大量優化，即使在大量殭屍群中也能順暢運行。</span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Zombie_Apocalypse_Last_Days_in_the_Wasteland/BH_Zombie_Apocalypse_Last_Days_in_the_Wasteland_screenshots.webp\" width=\"1401\" height=\"151\"></span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1200/517/zombie-apocalypse-3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1335\" height=\"689\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1200/518/zombie-apocalypse-4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1335\" height=\"689\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1200/521/zombie-apocalypse-7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1335\" height=\"689\"></span></p>",
